    <briefdescription>
<para>Coverage of one CK or SPK, as interval rows. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The vectors are row-aligned: row i of interval_starts, interval_stops and interval_body_codes describes one interval. Rows are sorted by start time. start_time and stop_time are the kernel&apos;s bounds, the same values getKernelStartStopTimes returns. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
